{"id": "home-subsidy-cap-800-presidio", "title": "A housing loan at 800 Presidio exceeded the federal subsidy limit by $1.16 million", "seconds": 52.5, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "c760125d136d6eda", "words": 156, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "One affordable housing loan grew after litigation delayed construction.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.62, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["One", "housing", "loan"], "sub": "A loan grew after litigation delayed construction"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.64, 1.01, 1.24, 1.49, 1.8, 2.36, 2.71]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "San Francisco had first checked a federal contribution of 4.3 million dollars.", "t0": 3.74, "t1": 8.77, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "finding", "kicker": "A loan grew after litigation delayed construction", "text": "Initial commitment", "mark": "Initial"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 1.01, 1.24, 1.56, 2.0, 2.12, 2.47, 3.25, 3.44, 3.71, 3.95, 4.18, 4.52]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The City raised the federal share to $8,134,000.", "t0": 8.89, "t1": 12.71, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["Initial federal share", "$4.3 million"], ["Federal share", "$8,134,000"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.47, 0.79, 0.93, 1.3, 1.62, 1.76, 2.03, 2.26, 2.58, 2.78, 3.12]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The federal rules set a limit based on the homes being financed.", "t0": 12.93, "t1": 16.44, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "finding", "kicker": "The federal share exceeded the project limit", "text": "Per-unit limit", "mark": "Per-unit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.54, 0.85, 1.04, 1.14, 1.47, 1.81, 1.9, 2.01, 2.29, 2.55]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "That left over a million dollars above the limit.", "t0": 16.56, "t1": 18.76, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["Federal commitment", "$8,134,000"], ["Project limit", "$6,976,330"], ["Excess", "$1,157,670"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.45, 0.71, 0.86, 1.25, 1.58, 1.82, 1.95]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The auditors said the housing office knew about the excess when it approved the increase.", "t0": 18.88, "t1": 23.09, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "finding", "kicker": "The federal share exceeded the project limit", "text": "Audit finding", "mark": "Audit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.64, 0.83, 0.94, 1.34, 1.7, 1.88, 2.1, 2.25, 2.78, 2.95, 3.04, 3.46, 3.6]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In December 2016, local funds replaced the excess.", "t0": 23.21, "t1": 26.66, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Local funds replaced the excess"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.57, 0.82, 1.74, 2.06, 2.33, 2.75, 2.89]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "HUD credited the money back for other eligible housing projects.", "t0": 26.78, "t1": 30.21, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "refund", "kicker": "Local funds replaced the excess", "text": "Federal credit restored", "mark": "Federal"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.82, 0.95, 1.21, 1.49, 1.67, 1.95, 2.39, 2.75]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The following audit marked the corrective action complete.", "t0": 30.33, "t1": 33.12, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "refund", "kicker": "Local funds replaced the excess", "text": "Corrective action implemented", "mark": "Corrective"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.58, 0.9, 1.16, 1.28, 1.72, 2.17]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The audit left out the address. Two other public records supply it.", "t0": 33.34, "t1": 37.28, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Which project?"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.59, 0.82, 0.99, 1.09, 2.11, 2.38, 2.62, 2.94, 3.29, 3.7]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The City identified 800 Presidio as its only HOME program-income project that year.", "t0": 37.4, "t1": 42.39, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "activity", "kicker": "An independent federal record identifies the project", "text": "800 Presidio", "mark": "800"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.43, 1.02, 1.28, 1.58, 2.28, 2.46, 2.64, 2.97, 3.26, 4.04, 4.45, 4.66]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The federal record lists fifty homes and the exact corrected amount.", "t0": 42.51, "t1": 45.89, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["HUD activity", "8031"], ["HOME-assisted units", "50"], ["Final HOME funds", "$6,976,330"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.51, 0.84, 1.12, 1.46, 1.81, 1.93, 2.03, 2.39, 2.87]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "That match traces the change through to the final federal financing.", "t0": 46.01, "t1": 49.14, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Final financing"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.58, 1.0, 1.1, 1.45, 1.73, 1.83, 1.95, 2.25, 2.55]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 49.26, "t1": 51.63, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 0.94, 1.27, 1.38, 1.49, 1.76, 2.01]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "A loan grew after litigation delayed construction", "b": "The federal share exceeded the project limit", "o": "An independent federal record identifies the project"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "question"}